msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | What it tells you or does | Step | Docs |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Specially calibrated instructions | Non-standard calibrations that can benefit some experiments. | 2.1 | [Documentation](/guides/custom-calibration) |\n"
"| Qubit quality benchmarking | Refreshes device properties data. | 2.2 | [Tutorial](/tutorials/refresh-backend-properties-with-real-time-benchmarking) |\n"
"| Timing for scheduled circuits | Visualizes when each instruction runs, to help spot idle time and inefficient instruction alignment. | 2.4 | [Documentation](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) |\n"
